  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>iii</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>are inconsistent.&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mo>&#8756;</mo></mtd><mtd><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>and</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>It is possible only when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
